ko:
SHA-512 + bcrypt 기반의 password-only 인증을 제공합니다.

이 플러그인은 Ricardo Garcia (@rg3) 님이 작성하신 libbcrypt를 기반으로 합니다.
@rg3 님의 libbcrypt는 CC0-1.0 라이선스 하에 배포되고 있으며, team unstablers Inc. 에서 Noctiluca Server 개발을 위해 포크한 버전은 https://github.com/team-unstablers/libbcrypt/ 에서 확인하실 수 있습니다.

comment:
Provides password-only authentication using SHA-512 + Bcrypt.
This plugin is based on libbcrypt written by Ricardo Garcia (@rg3).
@rg3's libbcrypt is distributed under the CC0-1.0 license, and the forked version by team unstablers Inc. for Noctiluca Server development can be found at https://github.com/team-unstablers/libbcrypt .

en:
Provides SHA-512 + bcrypt based password-only authentication.

This plugin is based on libbcrypt written by Ricardo Garcia (@rg3).
@rg3's libbcrypt is distributed under CC0-1.0 license. The forked version by team unstablers Inc. for Noctiluca Server development can be found at https://github.com/team-unstablers/libbcrypt/.
